{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_sunbr_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sunbr_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "成长",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sunbr_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb0b5b77931609251da75a617f59373731bf988aac8334c49e96ea62ab47818d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "古米有很多回忆。\n好的，坏的。\n快乐的，悲伤的。\n还有不管怎么样都忘不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "她们在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "快点过来，她们逃不了了......她们有食物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "拉达，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "啧，一群臭虫！安娜，拉达，到我身后来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "好啊，你们胆子不小，来啊，我看谁敢上前！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗莎琳",
      "text": "好痛啊，怎么又来了，我胳膊还没好全呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗莎琳",
      "text": "喂，索尼娅，我们要不要比比看，谁能解决掉更多人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "少说废话......小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜塔莉娅",
      "text": "哎呀，在这种时候走神可不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜塔莉娅",
      "text": "两位将军，要专心啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "呼......好险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "索尼娅，罗莎琳，小心身后。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "谢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗莎琳",
      "text": "敢偷袭我，看来你们是做好准备了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女学生",
      "text": "不、不要慌，别被她们吓到，她们只有这么点人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "对，她们只有这么点人！别给她们机会喊救援，我们一起上，一定没问题！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜塔莉娅",
      "text": "（怎么办？对面说得对，我们人数不占优势。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "（......只能想办法冲出去了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女学生",
      "text": "对不起啊，但是......我们也没有办法，我们必须要拿到食物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女学生",
      "text": "我不想挨饿......我不想在这种地方饿死啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "别给她们逃走的机会，把门堵住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "我们上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "咳、咳咳，这群混账，没完没了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗莎琳",
      "text": "你该不会撑不住了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗莎琳",
      "text": "呸。哎，我好像掉了一颗牙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜塔莉娅",
      "text": "等等，他们人数不对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "索尼娅，小心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索尼娅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "把食物交出来！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "呃啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "咳......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "（倒地抽搐）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安娜",
      "text": "拉达......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "text": "不许对索尼娅姐动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "text": "不许......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女学生",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女学生",
      "text": "她疯了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男学生",
      "text": "她把安德烈的脖子砸断了！小心，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "text": "拉达......拉达要保护大家......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉达",
      "text": "不许你们伤害姐姐们！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "古米有很多回忆。\n好的，坏的。\n快乐的，悲伤的。\n还有不管怎么样都不愿意再想起的。\n古米伤害了别人。\n到底是为了保护姐姐们，还是为了自己不受伤呢？\n古米分不清。\n但古米......古米已经不想再伤害任何人了。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "古米？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怎么在这种地方睡着了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "醒一醒，古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "唔......呼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "醒一醒，古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "怎么脸色这么差，伤口还痛吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好像做了个噩梦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "伤口已经一点都不痛了，真理姐别担心，古米没事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "唔？真理姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "怎么不说话，是要出发了吗？古米随时都可以走，凛冬姐和烈夏姐呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "不是，还没到出发时间，还可以再休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "其他人出去探路，应该过一会就回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "那古米也去帮忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "哎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "等一下，古米，你别乱动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你的伤没有你说的那么轻巧吧。别乱动，我给你重新上一次药。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "其实真的没有很严重啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "真的！古米保证！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "只是，只是稍微有一点点痛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "乖乖别动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好的真理姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......好多伤口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "之前的伤，疤痕已经有点淡了。今天这一道伤口不知道会不会留下印记。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "希望不要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "医疗部的姐姐们会给古米超级好用的药膏，每天涂一涂，一定能把不好看的伤疤都消除掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "是啊，身上的伤这一年多来都治得差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "但是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，刚刚我们被那群赏金猎人袭击的时候，其实你是可以不受伤的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "为什么没有继续追击？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "最后一击的时候，你的手顿住了，你在犹豫......这很危险，古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可是，可是古米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米没有办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......古米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "其实坚雷教官也和我提过你的习惯问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你在害怕，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米很害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "第三下，古米控制不住自己......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米会想起、想起在学校的时候，晚上会做噩梦，就算开着小夜灯也没有用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我......知道，你睡不着，就会不断翻身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我知道，凛冬也知道，这件事只能靠你自己克服，所以我们不会多说什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "但是古米，我们都很担心你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米在努力......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "嗯，你很努力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你是我们之中最坚强的那一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米现在已经不需要小夜灯，也可以睡着了，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "虽然有的时候还是会跑来找我和凛冬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米要努力长大，努力把不好的习惯都改掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米问了阿米娅和凯尔希医生，医生说，古米的爸爸妈妈在做很危险的工作，想要见到爸爸妈妈会很难很难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你想去找他们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "想。但是现在还不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米不希望爸爸妈妈看到古米现在的样子。见面的时候，不希望爸爸妈妈觉得古米是个坏孩子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "所以现在还不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......你不是坏孩子，古米。你是在保护我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "但是、但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米还是做不到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米控制不住自己，会伤害到别人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "真理姐，古米到底该怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......会有办法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "就算一时改不过来，也没有关系。我们都在你身边，古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我们都陪着你，别害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......真理姐......",
