    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "哎呀痛，别戳别戳，痛啊真理姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "现在知道痛了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "药涂好了，凛冬她们差不多也该回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我们一起去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你们休息好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凛冬姐，古米已经没事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "伤口已经处理好了，应该不影响行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你们那边怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "前面的村子不太对劲，太安静了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "可能还是那拨赏金猎人在搞鬼，一会大家都小心点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "明明只是寻找走丢孩子的任务而已，哎呀，真是出乎意料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "怎么就惹上那些赏金猎人了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？是对方先挑衅的吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那群混账还绑了两个孩子！我们要找的不就是孩子吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "行了，既然碰上了，就没有现在回头不管的道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "之前被他们逃了，这次可不会这么简单......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "要小心些，那些人不好对付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "他们手上有孩子在，不能太过刺激他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "如果坏人再出现，就由古米来保护姐姐们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "放心吧，古米会把坏人都打趴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "但是，万一他们不出现呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯......揪出来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "真麻烦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我有一个想法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "你好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "请问有人吗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "你好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好像没有人在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，看来这次是调查不到什么了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "差不多了，我们回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "这可没办法交差啊，看来只能下次拜托其他干员再来一趟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "嗯......下次应该就是经验丰富的前辈们来了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "是、是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我听说，那什么......哦对，有个超级强也当赏金猎人的前辈，据说能徒手拆、拆大楼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "（叹气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "（罗莎琳，演得太差了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "（我不擅长这种的啊！！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "走啦走啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "前辈们一定能把坏人都抓出来的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（有声音，来了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "呼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "挡下来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
