    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "快说，这个村子怎么回事，还有你们抓走的两个孩子在哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "不说的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不说的话，就、就把你的牙齿和头发都拔掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "（......那倒也不必。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "哼，几个小崽子......",
