    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "这就是你要说的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "不好意思——我拒绝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "现在是你挨打，凭什么和我们谈条件？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "就是就是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "（他也沉默了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "（不会真的咬死不说吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "（有点难办，总不至于真的要逼供......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "再抽他两巴掌不就结了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，说得太大声了啦，凛冬姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "居然敢小看我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "——该死的熊崽子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凛冬姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "什么——？！呃啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你卑鄙......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "卑鄙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "手段只要有用就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "去死吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "索尼娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "该死，你这小鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "咳，呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不许......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不许伤害索尼娅姐......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "还差一下......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "等等，古米！我没事，别冲动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我们还要问出孩子们的下落！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我、我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的赏金猎人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "古米......还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好惨，他死了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "没有，他还活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "亲爱的罗莎琳，可以麻烦你帮我把这位先生抬到那边去吗？我要帮他止血，顺便让他“清醒”过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "没问题是没问题......但你干嘛突然这样喊我，怪吓人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "好了好了，过来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凛冬姐，伤口......在流血，我、我帮你包扎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......对不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "对不起，凛冬姐，真理姐。古米......又闯祸了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "别说傻话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你闯什么祸了？你是救了我，我谢你还来不及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "没有可是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，你在害怕，但还是保护了我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "说得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "况且......古米，我清楚你的力气有多大。如果你真的全力打中对方的脑袋，他现在早就该没气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "那、那他——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "放心，人没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "能不能再敲他一次，直接把他敲醒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "没事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米、古米控制住了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你控制住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "最后的那一下，你明明已经挥出去了，但是又收住了力道，我看得很清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "还有凛冬，也过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不叫上我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这是要玩什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "吵死了，你别挤我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "满地狼藉中，乌萨斯学生自治团的孩子们亲密地聚在一起。\n真理牵起古米的左手，凛冬拉起右边那只。小熊们手拉着手，头挨着头，即使被他人的鬓发扫得面颊发痒，也没有人退开。\n古米将脑袋挤在同伴中间，用额头轻轻碰碰同伴的前额，就像是她们一直以来玩耍时做的那样。\n然后她获得了一个亲密的回撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，还记得我之前说的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你已经做得很好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "别怕，我们都陪着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "没错没错，小古米做得真不错！最后那一下挡得漂亮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呵呵，已经快要比还控制不住自己脾气的某人要强咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啥？你说谁？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凛冬姐别跳起来，小心伤口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米、古米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米真的......做到了？真的没、没用全力？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "没有。你做到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我们一会就能把对方叫醒，然后问出那些孩子的下落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "放心，我会让他说出来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，你不仅保护了我们，还救了那几个孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米......控制住了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......古米做到了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "要带上这个，还有这个......嗯，多带点小面包！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "呼，背包终于收拾好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "爸爸妈妈，拉达马上要准备去找你们了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "虽然凯尔希医生说会很难，但我还是想去试一试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "对了，拉达现在每次打人的时候已经不会再有停顿......也不会完全控制不住第三下的力气了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不会再让姐姐们担心......也不会让爸爸妈妈担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "多亏了姐姐们，虽然还是会做噩梦，但是现在拉达已经不会那么害怕了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "爸爸妈妈，拉达在这里过得很开心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，拉达还得去和姐姐们打声招呼，这还是拉达头一次自己出远门，但是我一定还会回来，姐姐们一定要等着拉达......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好，就录到这里好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——出发啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
